                        text "rule.name == \"phony\" string compares sit on hot paths: recompute_edge_dirty_with (src/graph.rs:259-261), Plan::add_node (build.rs:260-262), the scheduler loop (build.rs:1470-1474), command_edge_count (build.rs:483-489), and both collectors (graph.rs:628-635, 688-694). pool.name == \"console\" likewise (build.rs:1483-1487, build/command.rs:67-70). The phony rule and console pool are created exactly once in EnvState::new (env.rs:82-96): store their RuleId/PoolId there (or an is_phony bit on Edge) and compare integers everywhere."
                    }
                )
            }

            {
                id ronin-fast-hashing
                title "Adopt rapidhash-keyed maps for paths and log entries"
                log (
                    {
                        at 2026-07-30T08:10:36.547110155Z
